  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b90acb33a755d494cafdd1d36518e58b, type: 2}
    textENG: "Great. The train breaks down, and the station is closed.\r\n..This
      isn\u2019t even funny anymore."
    textPL: "No \u015Bwietnie. Poci\u0105g zatrzymany, a dworzec nieczynny.\r\n...To
      ju\u017C nawet nie jest zabawne."
    expressionName: annoyed
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b90acb33a755d494cafdd1d36518e58b, type: 2}
    textENG: "Alright... if I can\u2019t get in here, I guess I\u2019ll have to look
      around the area."
    textPL: "Dobra\u2026 skoro tu si\u0119 nie dostan\u0119, to chyba musz\u0119
      rozejrze\u0107 si\u0119 po okolicy."
    expressionName: default
